# Evidence Ledger

Every claim MUST include classification: DECLARED | OBSERVED | INFERRED | UNKNOWN.
Never silently promote INFERRED or UNKNOWN to fact.

## Entry format

```
claim_id: C-001
classification: OBSERVED
claim: <statement>
evidence: <source, query, paste reference>
source_agent: <agent-id>
confidence: high | medium | low
```

